WEBVTT

01:30.400 --> 01:33.800
ADAPTED FROM THE BLOSSOMING LOVE
BY SUI YU ER AN ON ICEREAD.COM

01:42.520 --> 01:43.360
Zai Xi?

01:44.360 --> 01:45.200
Why is she the one serving?

01:52.520 --> 01:53.200
FLOWERS BLOOMING LIKE A PIECE OF BROCADE

01:54.440 --> 01:55.440
Soul-Stealing Gu?

01:58.280 --> 01:59.920
How did this infamous evil gu poison

02:00.480 --> 02:01.600
from the Dark Abyss end up here?

02:02.600 --> 02:03.840
Master.

02:04.680 --> 02:05.680
Master!

02:10.880 --> 02:13.680
-Xuechen, leave!
-Let's go.

02:32.880 --> 02:34.720
How did Miss Su get infected
all of a sudden?

02:34.800 --> 02:35.880
Maybe she's been infected for a while.

02:37.520 --> 02:39.720
The symptoms were just delayed
because of her high cultivation level.

02:44.760 --> 02:45.680
SEAL

02:50.880 --> 02:52.280
How much of your spiritual power
have you regained?

02:52.360 --> 02:53.800
Less than 40%.

02:54.440 --> 02:56.600
Nan Xuyue, how long
will the Soul-Stealing Gu remain active?

02:56.680 --> 02:57.840
Six hours.

02:57.920 --> 02:59.320
Then it'll lose its effect.

03:00.240 --> 03:01.080
Everyone, leave.

03:01.160 --> 03:03.360
They can all go. I'll stay with you.

03:03.440 --> 03:04.600
This is the Mirror Palace.

03:04.680 --> 03:05.880
I'm not leaving, no matter what.

03:06.840 --> 03:07.800
No one can leave now.

03:19.720 --> 03:21.480
Don't kill them. They're still alive.

03:33.160 --> 03:34.000
How are we supposed
to fight them otherwise?

03:34.600 --> 03:36.400
They feel no pain and never tire.

03:37.000 --> 03:38.000
They'll wear us out!

03:40.600 --> 03:41.440
Those demonic vines…

03:45.720 --> 03:46.960
Sir!

04:16.640 --> 04:17.680
What are you doing?

04:17.760 --> 04:20.040
You won't let me kill them,
so this is the only option.

04:20.920 --> 04:21.760
Only demonic power

04:21.839 --> 04:22.920
can subdue the evil gu.

04:23.000 --> 04:24.480
I'm using evil to defeat evil.

04:40.800 --> 04:42.360
Enough! Stop!

04:44.800 --> 04:46.000
So, you do care about me.

04:53.640 --> 04:54.480
Stop!

05:03.440 --> 05:04.400
Master!

05:08.280 --> 05:09.240
Master.

05:10.200 --> 05:11.200
Master.

05:11.280 --> 05:12.880
Wake up, Master!

05:13.680 --> 05:15.080
This is when I should stop.

05:23.760 --> 05:24.600
Mu Xuanling.

05:24.680 --> 05:26.040
-Master.
-Mu Xuanling!

05:38.160 --> 05:41.320
WARBLE HALL

05:44.800 --> 05:45.920
How is she?

05:48.960 --> 05:50.920
Had Miss Mu been injured before?

05:51.920 --> 05:52.880
What do you mean?

05:54.400 --> 05:55.520
Her pulse indicates

05:56.120 --> 05:57.640
old injuries that haven't healed.

05:57.720 --> 05:59.800
On top of that,
she used her blood to form an array,

05:59.880 --> 06:01.400
causing her demonic energy to leak out

06:02.440 --> 06:04.880
and worsening her condition.

06:11.040 --> 06:12.240
What is it?

06:13.040 --> 06:14.320
Are her spiritual apertures damaged?

06:15.000 --> 06:16.080
Yes.

06:16.160 --> 06:17.160
She said so before.

06:22.560 --> 06:23.720
In that case,

06:25.640 --> 06:28.720
she can't cultivate spiritual power
like other members of the Spirit Clan.

06:29.480 --> 06:31.080
Nor can she form spiritual essence.

06:31.960 --> 06:33.320
Her only choice
is to absorb demonic energy

06:33.400 --> 06:34.720
to strengthen her demonic power.

06:36.040 --> 06:37.440
But for someone of the Spirit Clan,

06:37.520 --> 06:39.000
both leaking

06:39.720 --> 06:41.200
and absorbing demonic energy

06:43.280 --> 06:45.120
are agonizing.

06:48.320 --> 06:49.280
You're skilled in medicine.

06:50.480 --> 06:52.160
Is there any way to help her recover?

06:53.680 --> 06:54.520
Xuyue?

07:04.200 --> 07:06.800
I'm not familiar
with demonic power either.

07:10.040 --> 07:11.800
I'll check
the Mirror Palace's herb storage

07:14.880 --> 07:16.600
and see if there's anything she can use.

07:37.200 --> 07:38.880
Had Miss Mu been injured before?

07:40.360 --> 07:41.640
She has old injuries that haven't healed.

07:42.920 --> 07:44.400
On top of that,
she used her blood to form an array,

07:44.480 --> 07:46.360
causing her demonic energy to leak out…

07:46.440 --> 07:47.280
Be careful!

07:49.760 --> 07:51.880
…and worsening her condition.

08:08.760 --> 08:11.040
Feng Yao, do you know

08:11.640 --> 08:12.960
what fear feels like?

08:13.920 --> 08:15.160
Fear?

08:18.000 --> 08:19.480
Why do you ask, sir?

08:21.680 --> 08:22.640
I think I felt it.

08:24.680 --> 08:26.000
I think I was scared

08:26.680 --> 08:27.840
she might die.

08:31.640 --> 08:33.280
I'm not sure if that was fear.

08:34.120 --> 08:35.080
All I know is

08:37.080 --> 08:38.080
that I didn't want her to die.

08:39.000 --> 08:41.480
You haven't spent much time with her.

08:41.559 --> 08:43.159
Why are you so concerned about
this old acquaintance?

08:43.679 --> 08:44.600
I can't explain it.

08:46.240 --> 08:48.720
I just have this feeling that everything

08:49.840 --> 08:51.400
is meant to be.

08:53.560 --> 08:54.400
Do you think

08:55.680 --> 08:58.120
she could be the one
I've been dreaming of?

08:58.200 --> 09:00.400
She often appears in my dreams,

09:00.480 --> 09:02.040
but I can never clearly see her face

09:02.120 --> 09:03.880
or the place we're in.

09:03.960 --> 09:05.760
It all feels so familiar.

09:06.520 --> 09:08.760
Could Mu Xuanling be her?

09:09.680 --> 09:10.800
If you're unsure,

09:11.480 --> 09:13.080
spend more time with her

09:13.760 --> 09:15.040
to find out

09:15.120 --> 09:16.240
if she is.

09:35.440 --> 09:36.400
Xuanling.

09:41.600 --> 09:43.960
-Master.
-Come here.

09:44.960 --> 09:46.040
It's time to train.

09:56.280 --> 09:57.360
It hurts!

09:58.000 --> 10:00.560
Master, it hurts!

10:04.600 --> 10:05.800
Do you want power?

10:06.400 --> 10:07.800
Do you want revenge?

10:08.840 --> 10:09.840
Feel the demonic energy.

10:10.480 --> 10:12.120
Draw it into your body.

10:12.200 --> 10:13.280
Don't reject it.

10:14.040 --> 10:15.080
Remember,

10:15.160 --> 10:17.920
demonic energy
is the source of your strength.

10:18.600 --> 10:20.440
People will betray you.

10:21.240 --> 10:23.000
Feelings will betray you.

10:24.320 --> 10:27.560
The only thing you can rely on is power.

10:36.920 --> 10:38.200
Master,

10:38.280 --> 10:39.880
why is our cultivation

10:40.920 --> 10:41.800
so painful?

10:45.120 --> 10:46.080
Because

10:49.760 --> 10:51.320
we were born sinners.

11:08.600 --> 11:10.200
-Mu Xuanling.
-It hurts.

11:11.640 --> 11:13.680
-It hurts.
-Mu Xuanling.

11:41.760 --> 11:42.800
Is there really so much to write about?

11:43.360 --> 11:45.680
You may be used to being yourself,

11:47.440 --> 11:49.280
but I find you fascinating.

11:50.160 --> 11:52.920
What, are you curious
about how I describe you?

11:53.960 --> 11:55.800
-Want to take a look?
-I'm not curious.

12:10.280 --> 12:11.440
I was so kind to him,

12:12.440 --> 12:14.240
yet he snatched the horse
and left me behind.

12:15.120 --> 12:16.560
What a difficult person.

12:17.160 --> 12:18.080
WHAT A DIFFICULT PERSON

12:18.960 --> 12:20.680
He just killed a few hundred members
of the Dark Clan,

12:20.760 --> 12:21.720
yet he kept boasting about it.

12:21.800 --> 12:22.640
This half.

12:22.720 --> 12:23.760
It was quite over the top.

12:23.840 --> 12:25.480
It was impossible to miss.

12:25.560 --> 12:26.800
He's forgetful too.

12:27.400 --> 12:29.720
I can't believe
he trapped me in the array.

12:29.800 --> 12:31.280
This is infuriating.

12:31.360 --> 12:32.480
Xie Xuechen.

12:32.560 --> 12:33.600
You're the worst!

12:41.200 --> 12:42.800
ARROGANT AND FULL OF PRIDE

12:42.880 --> 12:45.160
SKILLED IN SWORDSMANSHIP
ARRAYS, AND MAKING ME MAD

12:45.240 --> 12:48.080
Today, he watched the moon with me.

12:48.800 --> 12:51.240
Well, to be precise,

12:51.320 --> 12:53.320
I insisted on watching the moon with him.

12:54.640 --> 12:57.600
The moon wasn't round or bright.

12:57.680 --> 12:58.760
There wasn't much to see.

12:59.840 --> 13:01.320
But standing there alone,

13:01.840 --> 13:03.280
he looked so lonely,

13:03.880 --> 13:05.320
so I was kind enough

13:05.400 --> 13:06.600
to keep him company.

13:07.640 --> 13:09.520
I talked to him about the Dark Abyss.

13:10.240 --> 13:12.480
He didn't comment on my past

13:13.360 --> 13:15.280
or share anything about his own.

13:16.800 --> 13:18.400
Sometimes I feel

13:18.480 --> 13:20.120
like I'm the blood moon in the Dark Abyss,

13:20.800 --> 13:21.760
while he is

13:22.280 --> 13:24.600
the bright moon of the human realm,
distant at times, yet close at others.

13:25.400 --> 13:26.920
We each have our own place,

13:27.000 --> 13:28.040
never crossing paths.

13:29.320 --> 13:30.400
But if it's possible,

13:31.040 --> 13:32.120
I want him to know

13:32.920 --> 13:33.920
that he doesn't have to

13:34.760 --> 13:36.160
live such a lonely life.

14:00.160 --> 14:01.240
Mr. Xie,

14:01.320 --> 14:03.600
I just took an arrow for you.

14:03.680 --> 14:05.320
Even if it was just an illusion,

14:05.400 --> 14:07.120
it still hurt a lot.

14:07.800 --> 14:09.560
Couldn't you at least show
some concern for me?

14:10.640 --> 14:11.800
Why don't you

14:11.880 --> 14:13.320
let me have the demonic essence

14:13.400 --> 14:15.000
that the Desire Demon
just transformed into?

14:15.080 --> 14:16.400
It would help strengthen my power.

14:59.120 --> 15:00.080
Mu Xuanling?

15:00.880 --> 15:01.840
Mu Xuanling?

15:24.960 --> 15:25.920
You're awake.

15:28.240 --> 15:29.480
Xie Xuechen!

15:34.560 --> 15:35.560
How do you feel?

15:35.640 --> 15:36.720
My body hurts.

15:38.160 --> 15:39.200
It hurts so much.

15:46.200 --> 15:47.240
My head hurts.

15:47.840 --> 15:49.120
My chest hurts.

15:49.800 --> 15:51.160
My hands and feet hurt.

15:54.880 --> 15:55.840
Everything hurts.

15:59.360 --> 16:00.200
Even the clothes

16:00.280 --> 16:01.440
I'm wearing

16:01.520 --> 16:03.800
feel like knives cutting into me.

16:08.400 --> 16:09.720
Circulate your power
to absorb the demonic energy

16:10.240 --> 16:11.240
and it won't hurt as much.

16:11.880 --> 16:12.920
Xie Xuechen,

16:13.840 --> 16:15.200
am I affected by the gu too?

16:16.240 --> 16:19.040
Why… Why does it hurt so much?

16:20.600 --> 16:21.920
You're not affected by the gu.

16:22.520 --> 16:23.880
You just consumed
the Desire Demon's demonic essence,

16:24.440 --> 16:26.280
so demonic energy is flowing back
into your body.

16:26.360 --> 16:27.760
You need to circulate
your power to take it in.

16:30.320 --> 16:31.920
The Desire Demon's demonic essence?

16:35.480 --> 16:36.440
All right,

16:37.440 --> 16:38.520
I'll try.

17:57.400 --> 17:59.680
Be unmoved, undisturbed,

18:00.280 --> 18:02.840
and egoless. No thought.

18:03.880 --> 18:06.760
Stay calm. Forget.

18:06.840 --> 18:08.720
Xie Xuechen, what are you doing?

18:23.440 --> 18:25.960
Miss Gao, is there anything you need?

18:27.720 --> 18:29.720
Mu Xuanling's demonic power
neutralized the Soul-Stealing Gu.

18:30.320 --> 18:32.040
I've cleansed everyone

18:32.120 --> 18:33.880
of the lingering demonic energy
with Brightmind Pills.

18:33.960 --> 18:35.640
They'll wake up tomorrow.

18:37.040 --> 18:38.960
I'm here because I want you to tell me

18:39.680 --> 18:42.000
the truth behind Mu Xuanling.

18:45.080 --> 18:47.760
It's true that she's a member
of the Spirit Clan.

18:47.840 --> 18:49.160
But with her spiritual apertures damaged,

18:49.240 --> 18:50.720
she has no choice
but to cultivate demonic power.

18:50.800 --> 18:53.920
It was she and I who fought you
at the staging post the other day.

18:54.680 --> 18:56.960
We just used magical artifacts
to hide our faces.

18:57.040 --> 18:59.720
I thought her demonic vines
looked familiar!

18:59.800 --> 19:01.280
You two have been lying to me
all this time.

19:01.360 --> 19:02.720
She tried to kill me that day!

19:02.800 --> 19:03.920
That was all a misunderstanding.

19:05.200 --> 19:06.160
Besides, it started with you

19:06.840 --> 19:08.560
mistakenly capturing a Treasure Sniffer

19:08.640 --> 19:09.760
and attacking first.

19:09.840 --> 19:11.920
You should see by now

19:12.000 --> 19:13.520
that Mu Xuanling has no ill intentions.

19:15.720 --> 19:18.000
So. now you're defending the Spirit Clan?

19:18.080 --> 19:19.440
Aren't you doing the same, Miss Gao?

19:19.520 --> 19:22.520
You're showing mercy
to the Spirit Clan too.

19:23.760 --> 19:25.600
I didn't, and I won't.

19:25.680 --> 19:27.640
You knew Mu Xuanling
was cultivating demonic power

19:27.720 --> 19:29.040
and was in a weak state.

19:29.680 --> 19:31.040
If you'd truly been against her,

19:31.880 --> 19:33.600
you could've had her arrested
by the Spirit Management Bureau.

19:33.680 --> 19:34.880
But instead, you let her

19:34.960 --> 19:37.120
stay in the Mirror Palace to recuperate

19:37.200 --> 19:39.360
and you came to me to ask about the truth.

19:40.080 --> 19:42.480
I just didn't want people
to think I couldn't tell right from wrong.

19:43.600 --> 19:45.960
And by the way, aren't you worried

19:46.560 --> 19:48.280
she'll betray your trust?

19:48.360 --> 19:50.360
Are you talking about Mu Xuanling

19:51.200 --> 19:52.280
or Cui Wanwan?

19:53.960 --> 19:55.400
I can trust you

19:56.160 --> 19:58.680
to keep Mu Xuanling's situation
secret from Miss Su, right?

19:59.360 --> 20:00.680
I'm not one to gossip.

20:00.760 --> 20:02.640
Keep an eye on her.
She's your responsibility.

20:05.960 --> 20:08.040
Mr. Nan, you arrived just in time.

20:10.080 --> 20:13.280
Could you tell me more
about the Soul-Stealing Gu?

20:13.880 --> 20:14.840
Why did everyone get affected?

20:17.880 --> 20:19.840
It's recorded in an ancient text.

20:20.520 --> 20:22.800
To make the poison, you need
to capture Dark Abyss gu worms,

20:22.880 --> 20:24.680
feed them with your own blood,

20:24.760 --> 20:26.360
and grind them into powder
when they mature.

20:26.440 --> 20:27.600
Then, coat an object with the powder,

20:27.680 --> 20:30.000
and anyone who touches the object
will become your puppet

20:30.080 --> 20:31.360
when you die.

20:31.440 --> 20:32.520
They'll forget everything,

20:32.600 --> 20:34.960
except your dying wish.

20:35.040 --> 20:37.120
The poison can also spread,
affecting many people.

20:37.840 --> 20:40.040
Where could this object be hidden?

20:40.120 --> 20:41.400
Even my master didn't notice it.

20:41.480 --> 20:43.960
It doesn't necessarily need to be hidden.

20:44.040 --> 20:45.640
It could be something so obvious

20:46.160 --> 20:48.080
that no one thought to question it.

20:48.160 --> 20:50.200
-What do you mean?
-Cui Wanwan did it.

20:51.800 --> 20:53.880
She knew the Rewinding Array
could be a trap,

20:54.440 --> 20:56.800
so she risked her life to sabotage it.

20:59.360 --> 21:00.200
She also had a backup plan.

21:04.160 --> 21:06.040
She put the Soul-Stealing Gu powder
on the token.

21:06.680 --> 21:07.680
If she survived,

21:08.280 --> 21:09.560
she would destroy the array

21:09.640 --> 21:10.840
and the spiritual essence herself,

21:10.920 --> 21:12.640
keeping her secret safe.

21:12.720 --> 21:15.280
But if she failed and died,

21:16.040 --> 21:17.560
the Soul-Stealing Gu would be activated,

21:18.560 --> 21:21.680
and naturally, someone would come
for Xie Xuechen's life.

21:22.600 --> 21:25.320
But her goal was to eliminate humans
and protect the Spirit Clan.

21:25.400 --> 21:26.440
Why would she want to kill Xie Xuechen?

21:27.960 --> 21:29.200
"Possessing something valuable
is to invite trouble."

21:30.720 --> 21:32.080
Xuechen knows the Jade Vault Technique.

21:32.160 --> 21:33.800
He's the most powerful human expert

21:33.880 --> 21:35.760
and the future pillar
of the Immortal Alliance.

21:36.320 --> 21:37.360
If she wanted to destroy humanity,

21:38.000 --> 21:40.040
she must first destroy
the hope of the human race.

21:43.280 --> 21:44.680
To complete her mission,

21:47.080 --> 21:48.680
she was willing to even risk her own life.

21:51.200 --> 21:52.240
She must have had a deep hatred.

21:55.760 --> 21:58.040
Sirs, I'm tired,

21:58.120 --> 21:59.120
so I'll take my leave now.

22:08.680 --> 22:10.040
-Why did you come back?
-What are you doing here?

22:15.440 --> 22:16.880
I've found a method

22:17.720 --> 22:20.480
that might ease Miss Mu's pain.

22:22.200 --> 22:23.960
Come on. Let's try it on her.

22:27.040 --> 22:29.240
Don't bother. She's fine now.

22:31.080 --> 22:32.120
Already?

22:35.000 --> 22:36.600
Perhaps her strength sped up her recovery.

22:36.680 --> 22:37.880
Anyway, she's already asleep.

22:37.960 --> 22:39.320
It's better if you leave her alone.

22:45.160 --> 22:46.280
You know what?

22:48.440 --> 22:49.600
You're not good at lying.

22:49.680 --> 22:50.800
Why would I lie to you?

22:50.880 --> 22:51.800
She really is asleep.

22:51.880 --> 22:53.080
I'm not talking about Miss Mu.

22:58.400 --> 23:00.880
You used to remain sober
after drinking 1,000 cups of wine,

23:01.920 --> 23:03.480
and earlier, you claimed to be

23:04.760 --> 23:05.680
a teetotaler?

23:07.800 --> 23:09.240
It was so obvious

23:10.680 --> 23:12.560
you were lying.

24:02.920 --> 24:04.720
Oh, Xie Xuechen,

24:05.920 --> 24:07.040
did it never occur to you

24:07.920 --> 24:09.440
what "Desire Demon" meant?

24:09.960 --> 24:12.400
How could you just feed me
her demonic essence like that?

24:14.640 --> 24:16.080
Don't hold my actions
from last night against me.

24:19.640 --> 24:20.680
How dare she poison us with gu!

24:21.440 --> 24:22.720
What a shame

24:22.800 --> 24:24.880
Cui Wanwan died just like that.

24:24.960 --> 24:26.480
If she hadn't, I would made her pay.

24:27.240 --> 24:29.080
If I'd known she was this vicious,

24:29.160 --> 24:30.840
I would've torn her to pieces long ago!

24:31.440 --> 24:33.680
Master, Cui Wanwan is already dead,

24:34.280 --> 24:36.480
and the turmoil
in the Mirror Palace has settled.

24:36.560 --> 24:39.360
Please don't work yourself up over her.

24:40.920 --> 24:42.640
I'm angry with her, not with you.

24:42.720 --> 24:43.840
Don't be scared.

24:43.920 --> 24:45.200
But Qiumin,

24:46.000 --> 24:47.200
after all this chaos,

24:47.880 --> 24:49.160
you should realize

24:49.760 --> 24:53.520
how few things
and people can truly be trusted.

24:53.600 --> 24:56.480
In the end, the only one
you can rely on is yourself,

24:57.120 --> 24:58.440
so you must make yourself

24:58.520 --> 25:01.040
stronger and more invulnerable.

25:02.000 --> 25:03.000
Do you understand?

25:04.520 --> 25:05.600
I understand.

25:17.160 --> 25:19.320
Although I don't remember
everything from last night,

25:20.000 --> 25:21.520
I do have some vague recollections.

25:22.680 --> 25:24.760
Xie Xuechen's spiritual power
hadn't fully recovered.

25:25.400 --> 25:27.560
How did

25:27.640 --> 25:29.680
the five of you

25:29.760 --> 25:31.560
quell such intense chaos?

25:33.240 --> 25:35.840
Although his spiritual power
hadn't fully recovered,

25:35.920 --> 25:37.400
he observed closely

25:37.480 --> 25:39.280
and found a flaw in the puppets.

25:39.360 --> 25:42.200
Combined with Nan Xuyue's
unparalleled arrays,

25:42.280 --> 25:44.680
the two of them neutralized
the gu poison without much effort.

25:57.600 --> 26:00.360
This time, we owe Snow City
and Greenview Heights a huge favor.

26:00.440 --> 26:01.880
Knowing we'll have to repay the favor

26:02.760 --> 26:06.840
sooner or later really makes me uneasy.

26:08.120 --> 26:11.440
In the Immortal Alliance, we look out
for each other like family.

26:12.800 --> 26:14.960
They won't expect anything in return.

26:17.360 --> 26:18.840
Look out for each other

26:21.320 --> 26:22.960
like family?

26:23.040 --> 26:25.080
Do you really believe that?

26:41.080 --> 26:43.800
I've heard that Immortal Alliance
cultivators rise with the sun,

26:44.520 --> 26:47.200
but Mr. Xie, you got up quite late today.

26:47.840 --> 26:50.640
Could it be that you were
lying awake all night,

26:50.720 --> 26:53.440
thinking about someone or something?

26:53.520 --> 26:54.800
Is that why you got up late?

26:55.400 --> 26:56.680
Stop talking nonsense.

27:01.720 --> 27:03.680
Is it nonsense?

27:03.760 --> 27:05.720
Or did someone

27:06.560 --> 27:07.880
take advantage of me

27:07.960 --> 27:09.400
while I wasn't fully sane?

27:11.320 --> 27:13.200
-Last night, you were the one who…
-What did I do?

27:20.160 --> 27:21.680
You were the one who fed me the pill.

27:22.640 --> 27:25.080
Who knows if you did it out of kindness
or if you had other motives?

27:26.000 --> 27:28.680
Maybe you said one thing
but meant another.

27:29.240 --> 27:30.800
You rejected me with words,

27:31.560 --> 27:33.280
but deep down…

27:37.760 --> 27:38.920
I only did it to save you.

27:41.360 --> 27:42.840
So you admit it.

27:44.120 --> 27:46.480
You do care about me.

27:53.160 --> 27:54.560
You care so much

27:54.640 --> 27:56.240
that you secretly
went through my notebook.

27:56.920 --> 27:58.440
I offered to let you read it,

27:58.520 --> 28:00.080
but you had to do it behind my back.

28:00.160 --> 28:03.880
Is it because you thought
peeking was more exciting?

28:03.960 --> 28:05.360
I didn't peek.

28:07.000 --> 28:08.520
I left your notebook
by your pillow last night,

28:08.600 --> 28:09.960
so that when you woke up, you'd see it

28:10.040 --> 28:11.080
and know I'd read it.

28:12.360 --> 28:14.680
I didn't try to hide anything,
so it doesn't count as peeking.

28:17.200 --> 28:18.160
Xie Xuechen,

28:19.120 --> 28:21.080
don't you think
that sounds like sophistry?

28:21.160 --> 28:23.320
You're just so stubborn.

28:25.920 --> 28:26.760
On the contrary,

28:27.440 --> 28:29.800
your lips are quite "open-minded".

28:30.360 --> 28:31.760
They welcome

28:32.520 --> 28:33.640
interaction with mine.

28:36.520 --> 28:38.600
So, you know how to dodge?
Then why didn't you dodge last night?

28:40.360 --> 28:41.680
Will you stop backing away?

28:42.680 --> 28:43.640
Give me a kiss.

28:48.480 --> 28:49.480
Miss Mu,

28:50.120 --> 28:52.360
why are you up so early
after exhausting yourself last night?

28:52.440 --> 28:53.640
Are you feeling better?

28:54.480 --> 28:57.320
Thanks to Mr. Xie's help last night,

28:57.400 --> 28:58.800
I'm almost fully recovered.

28:59.440 --> 29:01.040
I came here to thank him personally.

29:02.760 --> 29:03.720
The Immortal Alliance
is facing an emergency.

29:04.440 --> 29:05.600
I've wasted quite a bit of time
in the Mirror Palace.

29:07.000 --> 29:08.440
I should hurry back to Greenview Heights

29:09.080 --> 29:10.480
and use the Teleportation Array
to return to Snow City.

29:10.560 --> 29:11.680
Before I came here,

29:11.760 --> 29:14.960
I'd already arranged
for the array materials to be prepared.

29:15.040 --> 29:16.480
-When we…
-Let's go.

29:16.560 --> 29:17.880
Say our goodbyes to Miss Su.

29:19.000 --> 29:20.640
Why is he in such a hurry?

29:20.720 --> 29:22.080
It's not like I'm going to bite him.

29:23.280 --> 29:24.240
Wait for me!

29:32.240 --> 29:33.360
Miss Su,

29:33.920 --> 29:36.000
now that the chaos
at your palace has been resolved,

29:36.080 --> 29:37.400
I must leave to attend
to matters in Snow City.

29:37.480 --> 29:38.880
I'm here to bid you farewell.

29:39.400 --> 29:40.240
In that case,

29:40.920 --> 29:42.160
I won't keep you.

29:45.120 --> 29:47.440
But Mr. Xie, your spiritual power
hasn't fully recovered.

29:47.520 --> 29:50.160
Why don't I send some of my disciples
to escort you?

29:53.080 --> 29:55.720
Greenview Heights will take care of that.

29:55.800 --> 29:57.280
Don't worry, Miss Su.

29:58.560 --> 30:00.440
Besides, the Mirror Palace
has just been through a battle.

30:01.040 --> 30:02.360
You and your disciples
should take time to recover.

30:03.360 --> 30:04.240
Thank you for your kindness, Miss Su.

30:06.000 --> 30:08.240
Qiumin, see them off for me.

30:09.000 --> 30:09.960
Yes, Master.

30:12.000 --> 30:12.840
Farewell.

30:13.600 --> 30:14.880
This way, please.

30:28.760 --> 30:33.240
MIRAGE PALACE

30:33.320 --> 30:34.720
Miss Gao, this is far enough.

30:35.400 --> 30:37.280
Mu Xuanling, let me tell you this.

30:37.360 --> 30:39.040
I only kept your secret from my master

30:39.120 --> 30:40.760
out of respect for Xie Xuechen.

30:41.440 --> 30:42.840
You'd better turn over a new leaf
and start acting

30:42.920 --> 30:44.160
-like a decent--
-Person?

30:44.840 --> 30:47.120
For me to act like a human
is quite a challenge.

30:47.840 --> 30:49.640
Enough with the wordplay.

30:49.720 --> 30:50.840
If I ever catch you causing trouble again,

30:50.920 --> 30:52.240
I'll hand you over
to the Spirit Management Bureau myself.

30:52.320 --> 30:54.240
Thank you, Miss Gao, for your forgiveness.

30:54.320 --> 30:55.480
In return,

30:55.560 --> 30:59.120
I won't tell anyone about how you
mistakenly captured a Treasure Sniffer,

30:59.200 --> 31:01.320
took treasures from a little child,
and lost to me.

31:03.760 --> 31:05.400
Everyone can hear you.
Couldn't you keep it down?

31:05.480 --> 31:06.680
-Why are you like this?
-Like what?

31:12.400 --> 31:13.480
Since you're both interested
in making peace--

31:13.560 --> 31:14.880
We're not!

31:29.800 --> 31:31.000
Right.

31:37.080 --> 31:39.400
No matter what, you shouldn't
be arguing here and now.

31:39.480 --> 31:41.240
We're in a hurry. Stop bickering.

31:41.920 --> 31:43.040
Fine. See you never.

31:47.480 --> 31:50.880
Why are you so hostile toward Gao Qiumin?

31:51.680 --> 31:53.800
Do you have some past grudge against her?

31:54.720 --> 31:55.840
You're so forgetful.

31:55.920 --> 31:57.280
Even if I told you, you wouldn't remember.

32:03.080 --> 32:04.040
Am I forgetful?

32:16.400 --> 32:18.080
Bao, what do you think of this one?

32:20.160 --> 32:21.720
The aura of this crystal feels off.

32:21.800 --> 32:22.760
It's not 300 years old.

32:25.120 --> 32:26.840
It's at most 70 years old.

32:26.920 --> 32:28.760
-Only 70 years?
-See for yourself.

32:29.360 --> 32:31.360
But it looks so ancient.

32:32.040 --> 32:34.800
Bao, why don't you sniff it again,
just to be sure?

32:34.880 --> 32:36.080
Enough.

32:36.160 --> 32:38.560
Bao is a Treasure Sniffer.
She knows what she's doing.

32:38.640 --> 32:39.520
There's no way
she could be wrong about the age.

32:40.640 --> 32:42.520
Bao, take a break.

32:42.600 --> 32:44.600
If there's anything else you'd like
to eat, just let us know.

32:51.120 --> 32:53.280
Bao, why don't you have some snacks first?

32:53.360 --> 32:54.320
Sure.

32:58.440 --> 32:59.280
Xuanling?

33:00.160 --> 33:01.080
Xuanling!

33:02.120 --> 33:03.080
Bao!

33:04.040 --> 33:06.160
It's only been three days.
Do you really miss me that much?

33:06.240 --> 33:08.720
Perhaps I should've brought
you along to meet Gao Qiumin.

33:11.080 --> 33:12.760
I'd rather not.

33:14.160 --> 33:15.200
Mr. Xie,

33:16.080 --> 33:17.320
Mr. Nan,

33:17.400 --> 33:18.600
and Yao.

33:19.920 --> 33:20.880
Greetings, sir.

33:21.480 --> 33:22.840
Are the array materials ready?

33:22.920 --> 33:24.520
Yes. They're being refined now.

33:24.600 --> 33:25.480
It'll be done in the afternoon.

33:26.160 --> 33:27.080
In the afternoon?

33:28.480 --> 33:31.040
It seems you'll have to wait
half a day longer.

33:31.680 --> 33:32.680
Why don't you rest in your room?

33:32.760 --> 33:35.560
By the time you've regained your strength,
the refinement should be complete.

33:35.640 --> 33:36.920
Xuyue,

33:38.040 --> 33:39.000
thank you.

33:39.080 --> 33:40.240
Go get some rest.

33:40.760 --> 33:42.400
You'll have plenty to deal with

33:43.240 --> 33:44.760
when you return to Snow City.

33:54.640 --> 33:55.600
Xie Xuechen!

34:00.960 --> 34:01.920
What is it?

34:03.840 --> 34:05.040
You really are forgetful.

34:05.840 --> 34:07.160
You still owe me an answer.

34:11.480 --> 34:13.239
Fine. I'll ask you again.

34:14.080 --> 34:17.239
Can I go back to Snow City with you?

34:27.800 --> 34:28.760
Mu Xuanling,

34:29.800 --> 34:30.760
I have a question for you.

34:31.520 --> 34:33.880
-Answer me honestly.
-Sure.

34:33.960 --> 34:35.600
Do you really want to start anew

34:36.280 --> 34:37.120
outside the Dark Abyss?

34:47.320 --> 34:48.320
Don't move.

34:50.400 --> 34:52.360
You want my honest answer, don't you?

34:53.719 --> 34:54.880
You think

34:56.239 --> 34:58.200
I always tell half-truths,
and you can't tell

34:58.280 --> 34:59.560
when I'm being honest, right?

35:01.960 --> 35:02.920
Xie Xuechen,

35:04.240 --> 35:05.680
I wasn't always like this.

35:07.560 --> 35:08.960
There was a time

35:09.760 --> 35:11.680
when I treated others very sincerely.

35:13.680 --> 35:14.640
Do you believe me?

35:17.160 --> 35:18.480
However, in the Dark Abyss,

35:19.160 --> 35:21.440
sincerity and kindness
won't keep you alive.

35:23.800 --> 35:24.840
The Dark Abyss shows no mercy.

35:25.640 --> 35:26.760
It only respects strength.

35:28.560 --> 35:29.880
I had to fight my way through

35:30.480 --> 35:31.480
and hide behind a facade

35:32.760 --> 35:34.200
just to survive.

35:36.480 --> 35:37.440
Only by surviving

35:39.160 --> 35:40.800
could I meet the people I wanted to see

35:42.160 --> 35:43.360
and repay the debts I owed.

35:48.880 --> 35:51.000
I'm being completely honest with you now.

35:52.800 --> 35:54.200
I don't want to return to the Dark Abyss.

35:55.680 --> 35:57.320
I want to live under the sunlight.

36:00.160 --> 36:01.120
Will you

36:02.880 --> 36:03.840
take me with you?

36:26.000 --> 36:27.160
Your temperament

36:28.320 --> 36:29.840
doesn't align with Snow City.

36:32.440 --> 36:33.720
So, when we get there,

36:34.520 --> 36:36.600
you'll have to start
as an entry-level external disciple,

36:36.680 --> 36:39.320
refine your character,
and turn over a new leaf.

36:39.400 --> 36:40.280
Sure!

36:40.800 --> 36:43.040
-You mustn't use demonic power anymore.
-I won't.

36:47.880 --> 36:48.920
And no pestering me.

36:49.000 --> 36:50.080
I…

36:50.760 --> 36:52.400
That might be a bit difficult.

36:58.880 --> 36:59.840
All right,

36:59.920 --> 37:01.680
I'll try my best to restrain myself.

37:13.520 --> 37:14.800
Xuanling,

37:14.880 --> 37:16.760
did you really agree
to Xuechen's conditions?

37:18.360 --> 37:19.680
How dare you eavesdrop.

37:19.760 --> 37:21.720
Oh, Xuanling,

37:21.800 --> 37:23.040
I'm a Sniffer, remember?

37:23.960 --> 37:26.000
Are you really going
to stop pestering Xuechen?

37:27.000 --> 37:29.640
Of course not.

37:30.720 --> 37:32.360
So, you lied again!

37:32.440 --> 37:34.000
I didn't!

37:34.680 --> 37:36.360
I just said I'd try my best
to restrain myself.

37:36.440 --> 37:39.600
Whether I can succeed is another matter.

37:40.880 --> 37:43.560
Xuechen will be led astray
by you sooner or later.

37:44.200 --> 37:45.640
I'll take responsibility for that.

37:47.680 --> 37:49.680
Sir, aren't you going to ask her to stay?

37:52.120 --> 37:53.360
She's already made her choice.

37:54.640 --> 37:55.800
I can't change her mind.

37:57.480 --> 37:58.520
I couldn't keep her back then,

37:59.400 --> 38:00.640
and I certainly won't be able

38:02.440 --> 38:03.400
to keep her now.

38:06.440 --> 38:08.120
All those candies

38:09.280 --> 38:11.560
only earned me
this tiny bit of her affection.

38:13.000 --> 38:15.120
She's really hard to please.

38:27.840 --> 38:28.880
Father.

38:30.840 --> 38:31.840
Who were you

38:31.920 --> 38:34.680
-talking to just now?
-A young spirit slave.

38:34.760 --> 38:36.480
NAN WUJIU

38:42.960 --> 38:43.920
Did Mr. Gao

38:45.200 --> 38:46.680
refuse to lend us the Chaos Pearl?

38:49.120 --> 38:50.720
It doesn't matter if my extra sense

38:51.400 --> 38:53.920
can't be restored.
There's still a lot I can do.

38:55.360 --> 38:56.600
For example, I could help
improve Greenview Heights'

38:56.680 --> 38:58.080
-defenses--
-It doesn't matter?

38:59.120 --> 39:00.360
How could you say that?

39:01.160 --> 39:02.000
Do you have any idea

39:02.640 --> 39:04.000
what strength and glory

39:04.680 --> 39:06.000
your extra sense

39:06.600 --> 39:08.000
could've brought you?

39:10.240 --> 39:12.320
Greenview Heights is in decline.

39:12.400 --> 39:14.920
I'd always hoped
you could restore its glory.

39:15.520 --> 39:16.640
But look at you.

39:17.560 --> 39:19.720
You've become nothing but a cripple.

39:19.800 --> 39:22.000
And now you dare to tell me
it doesn't matter?

39:30.040 --> 39:34.040
Gao Fengxu wouldn't lend us
the Chaos Pearl. Let's go.

39:36.040 --> 39:37.200
Father,

39:38.640 --> 39:39.600
can I

39:40.240 --> 39:42.320
take that spirit slave with us?

39:43.000 --> 39:44.960
Are you joking?

39:45.520 --> 39:46.960
With three apertures destroyed,

39:47.040 --> 39:48.320
you're basically

39:49.080 --> 39:50.280
useless.

39:51.120 --> 39:52.280
What right do you have

39:52.360 --> 39:54.920
to ask the Immortal Alliance Leader
for a spirit slave?

39:55.440 --> 39:56.600
You…!

40:31.800 --> 40:33.560
We had a fleeting meeting
on an afternoon long ago.

40:34.480 --> 40:35.480
To her,

40:36.280 --> 40:38.320
I was just the most ordinary passerby.

40:42.760 --> 40:44.040
I couldn't take her with me then.

40:45.000 --> 40:46.160
Nor can I keep her now.

40:48.760 --> 40:50.320
When the timing isn't right,

40:51.600 --> 40:53.200
everything becomes a mistake.

40:56.000 --> 40:57.720
So, are you going to give up?

41:00.000 --> 41:00.960
Give up?

41:02.200 --> 41:05.000
I still haven't figured out
if she's the person I've been dreaming of.

41:05.600 --> 41:06.680
If she's not staying,

41:08.800 --> 41:10.320
I'll go with her.

41:12.080 --> 41:13.040
What's the harm in that?
